      "jobTitle": "Communications Lead",
      "shortDescription": "Communications Lead, CNTR",
      "bio": "Josephine is Communications Lead of CNTR and BrainGate. Josephine Buclez graduated from the University of Chicago with a BA in Chemistry and a BS in Biochemistry.",
