      "name": "Matthew Picard-Fraser, PT, DPT",
      "roleGroup": "Research Scientists",
      "jobTitle": "Research Fellow, Brain Recovery Lab",
      "shortDescription": "Research Fellow, Brain Recovery Lab",
      "bio": "Matthew Picard-Fraser, PT, DPT is part of the Brain Recovery Lab. The Brain Recovery Lab is a clinical neuroscience laboratory with special interest in helping people recover from neurologic injury, especially stroke and dystonia.",
