      "roleGroup": "Research Scientists",
      "jobTitle": "Research Fellow, MGH Ziv Lab",
      "shortDescription": "Research Fellow, MGH Ziv Lab\n\nNeurosurgery Resident, Massachusetts General Hospital",
      "bio": "Dr. William Munoz Miranda joined the Williams lab with an interest in cortical dynamics during cognitive processes. He received my MD and PhD in Neuroscience and Physiology from New York University, and is currently a Neurosurgery resident at MGH.",
      "photo": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/e6c040_5265569111764e17aef4e77ee9f555f2~mv2.jpg",
